Data and model outputs
  This repository contains code, configs, documentation and small metadata files, not training data or weights.
  The scripts download third-party datasets; each keeps its own licence and terms (see docs/DATA_LICENSES.md for every
  source, its licence and the credit it asks for). The model weights are on Hugging Face under udgamlabs/.
